                                "example_id": "5736fe79-667d-408b-bb88-b934fa5b3a8c",
                                "sense_id": "d9ef7232-b4b1-31ae-a216-fc56999c7cc8",
                                "text": "Stephano: He's in his fit now ; and doe's not talke after the wiſeſt ; hee ſhall taſte of my Bottle : if hee haue neuer drunke wine afore, it will goe neere to remoue his Fit :[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0699af72-1d0c-4280-af62-067a1af51352",
                                "sense_id": "d9ef7232-b4b1-31ae-a216-fc56999c7cc8",
                                "text": "A chap named Eleazir Kendrick and I had chummed in together the summer afore and built a fish-weir and shanty at Setuckit Point, down Orham way. For a spell we done pretty well."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c46b2468-7435-3859-8bdd-48f0faf2c0a3",
                        "entry_id": "3c7c91e2-7f76-30f5-91ef-294d1c61d5d8",
